{"id":"u-f89a0613-be8b-4104-96ef-7eae6ceeac86","src":"community","title":"Powerbuilding/Bodybuilding - Vince Gironda","author":"Mithosphere","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/hAwycc-powerbuildingbodybuilding-routine","desc":"As always, much will depend upon your genetic potential and body type, but you can successfully combine bodybuilding and powerlifting. Franco Columbu is the most obvious example. In the powerlifting world men like Doug Young, Dave Shaw, Jim Cash and Roger Estep have very balanced muscular builds despite being powerlifters. But you will have to do more than just a few curls and some ab work along with the three powerlifts to get big and strong.\n\nFollow a more traditional bodybuilding routine but stress the power lifts and do less reps and more weight in your exercises.\n\nThis is an example of a combination powerlifting/bodybuilding routine, and appropriate substitutions can be made depending on the individual.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-09T02:41:21.302Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Legs, Back & Abs","Chest, Delts & Arms","Legs, Back & Abs","Chest, Delts & Arms"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":2},{"r":8,"pct":70},{"r":6,"pct":75},{"r":4,"pct":80},{"r":2,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":2},{"r":8,"pct":70},{"r":6,"pct":75},{"r":4,"pct":80},{"r":2,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":2},{"r":8,"pct":70},{"r":6,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":77},{"r":4,"pct":80}]},{"n":"Sit Up","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60},{"r":8,"pct":70},{"r":6,"pct":75},{"r":4,"pct":80},{"r":1,"pct"